{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも沢山の声援、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しい時も皆さんからのコメントを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見て、元気をもらってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいつもありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに切っちゃいました(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテールは夏までお預けです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初心にもどるという意味で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビュー当時の高山に戻りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/11/9649400/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/11/9649400/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうですか(^^)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"--------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、3月8日に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は高校を卒業しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は気持ちの整理がなかなか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来ずにブログを書けませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、もう大丈夫です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は2年半は乃木坂に入る前の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通の女の子として"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校へ通っていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に合格してからの半年、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校との両立は大変だったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph",